WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:08.120
Speaker 1: We have stumbled across another
possible major scam from the Donald Trump

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:09.230
administration.

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:16.940
It turns out that the Trump administration
gave a one point three billion dollar contract

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:25.780
to a company called Apage Act like inject,
but maybe it's even API jacked like a look

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:28.740
at a computer API they gave him.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:34.410
He gave them a one point three dollars billion
contract to make covid vaccine syringes.

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:40.470
The U.S. has now given out about close to
200 million individual doses and there are

00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:47.550
zero vaccine syringes from abject applejack
to API ject.

00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:48.650
What the hell is going on?

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:50.070
We don't know.

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:55.750
NBC News reporting that a year after the company
was awarded and almost one point three billion

00:00:55.750 --> 00:01:05.239
dollar contract and loan package to supply
syringes for rolling out the covid-19 vaccine,

00:01:05.239 --> 00:01:07.810
zero syringes have been made.

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:16.759
The syringe hasn't even gotten the first approval
it needs from the FDA before it can be manufactured.

00:01:16.759 --> 00:01:22.460
And the factory that was going to create six
hundred and fifty jobs to create this.

00:01:22.460 --> 00:01:26.459
As yet, an approved vaccine has not even been
built.

00:01:26.459 --> 00:01:33.349
One point three billion contracts and loans,
no factory, no approval, no syringes.

00:01:33.349 --> 00:01:40.109
The company API JECT Systems Corporation said
it was going to be the company that would

00:01:40.109 --> 00:01:46.409
make the difference between a bad rollout
and a good rollout of the coronavirus vaccines.

00:01:46.409 --> 00:01:51.649
A thanks to the Biden administration, the
U.S. coronavirus vaccine rollout is going

00:01:51.649 --> 00:01:53.350
really well.

00:01:53.350 --> 00:01:56.859
About half of American adults have received
at least one dose.

00:01:56.859 --> 00:01:57.950
We are close.

00:01:57.950 --> 00:02:03.280
We are rapidly getting into the 30s and soon
40s in terms of the percentage of Americans

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:05.119
that have been fully vaccinated.

00:02:05.119 --> 00:02:13.610
The need for this syringe from API ject is
now drastically diminished because we basically

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:15.250
have what we need.

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:18.280
And it seems as though we are going to have
everything we need to fully vaccinate the

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:19.880
United States.

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:24.090
And yet the contracts and the loans are still
there.

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:26.190
API JECT was contacted by NBC News.

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:28.720
They were asked what the hell is going on?

00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:30.310
That was not how the question was asked.

00:02:30.310 --> 00:02:31.750
That's how I would ask it.

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:36.340
They said that they are, quote, working with
several pharmaceutical companies to conduct

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:43.540
testing and reviews of the API ject syringe
for covid-19 vaccination.

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:44.640
What?

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:46.230
When is this going to happen?

00:02:46.230 --> 00:02:49.310
It's going to be over before they make any
vaccine syringes.

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:58.250
A spokesperson from Pfizer said that even
if the syringe was approved by the FDA, it

00:02:58.250 --> 00:03:04.580
would have no impact on the level of vaccine
output or on the process for distributing

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:06.480
vaccines by Pfizer.

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:08.680
Moderna was asked, what about you?

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:09.680
They didn't respond.

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:13.440
Johnson and Johnson declined to comment on
this.

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:18.220
What it's just listen, we don't yet know the
full scope of this.

00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:23.040
There should be audits of every single one
of these contracts that the Trump administration

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:24.250
gave out.

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:29.290
If the recipients aren't at a stage in the
process that they should be or close to actually

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:34.430
being able to deliver what they were contracted
to do, the contracts, which I mean, they need

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:35.930
to be canceled.

00:03:35.930 --> 00:03:40.290
The government should be asking for money
back should lawsuits be filed to try to recoup

00:03:40.290 --> 00:03:47.310
the money that's already been paid, because
increasingly it seems that there is no economic

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:56.360
policy or contract or whatever it all during
the Trump administration seems to link to

00:03:56.360 --> 00:04:06.780
mostly unsuccessful either outright failures
or incompetency or participating in grifting

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:07.959
