00:04:25.949 --> 00:04:27.260
And they had like no employees.

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:28.710
They were a three month old.

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:32.860
It was just all grifting, grifting, grifting.

00:04:32.860 --> 00:04:39.539
API spokesperson Steve Hoffman says when asked
about the factory, because, remember, this

00:04:39.539 --> 00:04:46.689
