syringes at a new factory that would generate

00:04:46.689 --> 00:04:48.419
650 jobs.

00:04:48.419 --> 00:04:53.979
The spokesperson for AP, Steve Hoffman, was
asked by NBC News, Where's the factory?

00:04:53.979 --> 00:05:00.319
And he says that land has been cleared for
construction in North Carolina.

00:05:00.319 --> 00:05:05.830
Asked when will the actual construction begin,
Steve Hoffman was not able to say.

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:13.620
It seems likely that the land is not good,
that the factory is not going to be built

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:20.659
